        "content": "# Practical Worksheet 14: Gene Family Mini-Project Milestone Tracker & Lab Workbook\n\n**Course Code:** CBBI-501 / CBBI-502  \n**Course Title:** Concepts of Bioinformatics  \n**Session:** S14 (Mini-Project In-Lab Execution)  \n**Semester:** B.Tech. Bioinformatics, Semester II  \n\n---\n\n### Project & Team Identification Details\n- **Project Title:** __________________________________________________________________\n- **Assigned Gene Family:** `[ ] Globin` &nbsp;&nbsp; `[ ] Insulin/IGF` &nbsp;&nbsp; `[ ] Serpin` &nbsp;&nbsp; `[ ] Nuclear Receptor` &nbsp;&nbsp; `[ ] Cytochrome P450`\n- **Team Members:**\n  1. Name: _____________________________________ Roll No: __________________ Role: ____________\n  2. Name: _____________________________________ Roll No: __________________ Role: ____________\n  3. Name: _____________________________________ Roll No: __________________ Role: ____________\n- **Date of In-Lab Session:** __________________________________\n- **Scheduled Report Submission Date:** ______________________\n\n---\n\n### 1. In-Lab Milestone Sign-Off Sheet (Mandatory 20 Marks)\n\nEach team must demonstrate their active terminal/browser output to the Instructor/TA for sequential verification:\n\n| Milestone No. | Milestone Description | Target Time | Output Verified | TA / Instructor Signature |\n|:---:|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| **M1** | Multi-FASTA dataset curated & counted (`grep -c \"^>\"`) | Minute 20 | `[ ] Verified` | ______________________ |\n| **M2** | BLASTP & FASTA searches completed; hit table recorded | Minute 40 | `[ ] Verified` | ______________________ |\n| **M3** | Clustal Omega MSA loaded in Jalview; invariant residues identified | Minute 60 | `[ ] Verified` | ______________________ |\n| **M4** | Phylogenetic tree constructed, rooted, and nodes annotated | Minute 80 | `[ ] Verified` | ______________________ |\n| **M5** | ProtParam comparative matrix & PSIPRED prediction completed | Minute 100 | `[ ] Verified` | ______________________ |\n| **M6** | 3D structure loaded in VMD/Mol*; active site pocket distances labeled | Minute 120 | `[ ] Verified` | ______________________ |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Preliminary Data Summary Tables\n\n#### Table 14.1: Curated Dataset of Assigned Gene Family\n| Gene Symbol | Full Protein Name | Organism | NCBI Gene ID | RefSeq mRNA (`NM_`) | RefSeq Protein (`NP_`) | UniProt Accession | PDB Code (if known) |\n|---|---|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | | |\n\n#### Table 14.2: Multiple Sequence Alignment & Motif Mapping Summary\n| Feature / Motif Name | Consensus Pattern / Sequence | Aligned Column Range | Invariant Residues (`*`) | Key Biological Function |\n|---|---|:---:|:---:|---|\n| | | | | |\n| | | | | |\n| | | | | |\n| | | | | |\n\n#### Table 14.3: Comparative Physicochemical Profile Summary\n| Protein Symbol | Length (aa) | Molecular Weight (Da) | Theoretical $pI$ | Total Net Charge (at pH 7.0) | Instability Index ($II$) | GRAVY Score |\n|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | |\n| | | | | | | |\n\n#### Table 14.4: 3D Macromolecular Active Site Pocket Geometry\n| PDB ID Code | Experimental Method | Resolution ($\\text{\\AA}$) | Ligand / Prosthetic Group | Key Catalytic / Binding Residues | Measured Coordination Distances ($\\text{\\AA}$) |\n|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| | | | | | |\n\n---\n\n### 3. Intermediate Execution Transcript & Working Notes\n\nRecord significant command executions, parameter adjustments, or troubleshooting notes:\n\n```\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                    WORKING NOTES LOG                                    |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n|                                                                                         |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. 4-Page Final Report Submission Checklist\nBefore submitting the final PDF report, confirm adherence to all guidelines:\n- [ ] Strict 4-page limit adhered to (no overflow to page 5).\n- [ ] All 11 required manuscript sections included.\n- [ ] Rendered figures are high-resolution with informative captions and labeled arrows.\n- [ ] Both paralogues (gene duplications) and orthologues (speciations) identified on phylogenetic tree.\n- [ ] Invariant functional residues mapped to 3D atomic coordinates.\n- [ ] All literature citations properly formatted in APA or Vancouver style.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Final Evaluation & Grading Grid (Instructor / TA Use Only)\n\n| Component | Maximum Marks | Marks Awarded | Comments / Remarks |\n|---|:---:|:---:|---|\n| **In-Lab Milestones & Verification** | 20 | | Full sign-offs completed during lab session |\n| **Data Provenance & Search Rigor** | 15 | | Clean sequence dataset, comprehensive BLAST/FASTA |\n| **MSA & Phylogenetic Analysis** | 20 | | Accurate alignment curation, sound tree interpretation |\n| **Physicochemical & Secondary Profiling** | 15 | | Accurate ProtParam metrics, valid $Q_3$ calculation |\n| **3D Structure Mapping & Figure Quality**| 15 | | High-resolution VMD/Mol* renders with labeled geometry |\n| **Scientific Discussion & Report Polish** | 15 | | Scientific depth, strict 4-page layout, formatted citations |\n| **Total Score** | **100** | | Scaled to **10%** of total course grade |\n\n**Instructor / TA Signature:** _______________________________ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; **Date:** _______________\n"
